# Files excluded from the Cloudflare upload.
#
# The camera masters are archive copies: 4-33 MB each, and Cloudflare caps a
# single asset at 25 MiB (one master is 31.8 MiB), so the build fails while any
# of them are in the output directory. They are also not needed at runtime --
# every photo is served from its WebP derivative under assets/opt/.
#
# Kept in this file as well as .gitignore so the deploy stays correct even if
# the masters are ever committed again.
assets/photos

# Build tooling, not part of the site.
scripts
